OL,3,GNEWSANew private partner to run
OL,4,Aloss-making market
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company is to be appointed to run a
OL,7,Fmarket which has been losing money
OL,8,Fsince it was refurbished at a cost of
OL,9,F#8m in 2024.
OL,11,FThe Cornhill Market in Lincoln will
OL,12,Fstill be controlled by the city
OL,13,Fcouncil, but a commercial partner would
OL,14,Fcover all costs and keep all the
OL,15,Fincome.
OL,17,FThe decision was made at a council
OL,18,Fmeeting on Tuesday after advice from
OL,19,Fretail experts that a new direction was
OL,20,Fneeded, according to the Local
OL,21,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
