OL,3,GNEWSANew private partner to run
OL,4,Aloss-making market
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Joshua Wells, the portfolio
OL,7,Fholder responsible for overseeing the
OL,8,Fmarket, said he was confident of the
OL,9,Fmarket's future if the changes were
OL,10,Fmade.
